- The source contains one instruction paragraph followed by one empty 200px by 200px div.
- The tested declaration is background: bottom repeat-x url("support/blue15x15.png") green; and is preserved verbatim.
- The green field and horizontally repeated blue image at the bottom make position, repeat, image, color, and token ordering visually observable.

